# No Implementation Plan Files

NEVER create implementation plan documents (e.g. `docs/superpowers/plans/*.md`, or any "implementation plan" markdown).

- After a design is approved, implement the code directly.
- Do not invoke writing-plans or equivalent workflows that produce plan files.
- Design specs under `docs/superpowers/specs/` are fine when brainstorming requires them; plan files are not.
- If a skill or checklist says to write an implementation plan file, skip that step and code instead.
